# Update IDs/tokens and refresh workVersion after every distinct command.
# Use the same concrete requestId/payload for retries. {{$uuid}} generates a fresh ID on every send.
# Quotes/completion do not charge a tenant, transfer funds or pay out a provider.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@ownerToken = replace-owner-token
@tenantToken = replace-tenant-token
@providerToken = replace-provider-token
@organizationId = replace-owning-organization-uuid
@providerId = replace-service-provider-organization-uuid
@propertyId = replace-property-uuid
@leaseId = replace-lease-uuid
@offerId = replace-offer-uuid
@workId = replace-work-request-uuid
@quoteId = replace-current-quote-uuid
@visitId = replace-current-visit-uuid
@imageId = replace-evidence-uuid
@workVersion = 0
@profileVersion = 0
@offerVersion = 0
@startAt = 2026-10-16T10:00:00Z
@endAt = 2026-10-16T11:00:00Z
@validUntil = 2026-10-17T10:00:00Z
@profile = {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/{{providerId}}/service-profile
@T = {{host}}/api/v1/me/work-requests/{{workId}}
@M = {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/work-requests/{{workId}}
@P = {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/{{providerId}}/service-jobs/{{workId}}

### Public provider discovery (NOT_VERIFIED business listings)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/service-providers?category=PLUMBING&country=KE&city=Nairobi&limit=50&offset=0

### Provider creates a private profile under a SERVICE_PROVIDER organization
POST {{profile}}
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Repairs team","description":"Plumbing inspection and repair services supplied by our team.","areas":[{"countryCode":"KE","city":"Nairobi"}]}

### Create a draft offer; quote-only pricing omits amount
POST {{profile}}/offers
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"category":"PLUMBING","title":"Plumbing inspection","description":"Inspect a reported plumbing fault and propose an agreed repair.","priceUnit":"QUOTE_REQUIRED","currency":"KES"}

### Activate selected offer before publishing its profile
POST {{profile}}/offers/{{offerId}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{offerVersion}},"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Publish profile explicitly; set profileVersion from GET first
POST {{profile}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{profileVersion}},"status":"ACTIVE"}

### Tenant submits maintenance from their ACTIVE lease (no provider preselection)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/me/work-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","leaseId":"{{leaseId}}","kind":"MAINTENANCE","category":"PLUMBING","priority":"NORMAL","title":"Kitchen tap leak","description":"The kitchen tap has a persistent leak; please inspect and arrange repair."}

### Alternative: private personal booking from SIGNED/ACTIVE lease
POST {{host}}/api/v1/me/work-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","leaseId":"{{leaseId}}","kind":"SERVICE_BOOKING","category":"PLUMBING","priority":"NORMAL","title":"Personal service booking","description":"Please inspect this personally requested plumbing service scope.","offerId":"{{offerId}}","offerVersion":{{offerVersion}}}

### Refresh workVersion and selected quote/visit IDs
GET {{T}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Manager requests missing maintenance information
POST {{M}}/request-information
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"priority":"NORMAL","message":"Please describe when the leak occurs and attach a photograph."}

### Occupant responds; work returns to SUBMITTED
POST {{T}}/respond
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"message":"The tap leaks continuously even when fully closed."}

### Manager triages maintenance
POST {{M}}/triage
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"priority":"HIGH","message":"Inspection needed; review provider availability."}

### Assign the current active offer (offerVersion changes after activation/edit)
POST {{M}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"offerId":"{{offerId}}","offerVersion":{{offerVersion}},"message":"Provider selected for the reviewed maintenance category and area."}

### Alternative from TRIAGED: internally handled maintenance
POST {{M}}/assign-internal
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"message":"The property management team will handle this repair internally."}

### Provider's scoped job; premises withheld until acceptance
GET {{P}}
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Provider accepts assignment
POST {{P}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"message":"We accept the assigned service request."}

### Provider proposes a job-specific TOTAL quote, using selected offer's currency
POST {{P}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"amount":"1500.00","currency":"KES","validUntil":"{{validUntil}}","scope":"Inspect the kitchen tap, replace the agreed fitting and test for leaks."}

### Maintenance procurement quotes: owner/agency read, occupant cannot read
GET {{M}}/quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Owner administrator authorizes maintenance cost (agency cannot approve owner spending)
POST {{M}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"consent":true,"message":"I reviewed and authorize this exact repair quote."}

### For a personal booking, the customer instead uses T/quotes/{quoteId}/accept
# No actual payment or rent charge is created by quote approval.

### Provider proposes visit; internally handled work uses M/visits instead
POST {{P}}/visits
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"startAt":"{{startAt}}","endAt":"{{endAt}}","accessInstructions":"Ring the bell and meet the occupant at the entrance."}

### Occupant separately grants access and reserves provider calendar capacity
POST {{T}}/visits/{{visitId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"consent":true,"message":"I agree to this visit time and will provide access."}

### Start only during the accepted visit window; internal work uses M/start
POST {{P}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"message":"The occupant provided access and work has started."}

### Provider uploads private photo; replace local image path
POST {{P}}/evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=workEvidence

--workEvidence
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="requestId"

{{$uuid}}
--workEvidence
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="version"

{{workVersion}}
--workEvidence
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="visibility"

SHARED
--workEvidence
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

Replaced fitting after repair
--workEvidence
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="repair.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:/replace-with-local-photo/repair.png
--workEvidence--

### Submit completion report; internal work uses M/submit-completion
POST {{P}}/submit-completion
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"summary":"Inspected the tap, replaced the agreed fitting, tested the seals and checked for leaks."}

### Customer reviews actual work; personal booking completes here
POST {{T}}/confirm-completion
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"consent":true,"message":"I inspected the repair and confirm that the reported issue is resolved."}

### Maintenance additionally needs manager approval
POST {{M}}/approve-completion
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"consent":true,"message":"Occupant confirmation and completion report reviewed; maintenance approved."}

### Alternative to accepting unresolved work: open a dispute case
POST {{T}}/disputes
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"message":"The tap still leaks; please review the completion report and arrange rework."}

### Manager requests maintenance rework; personal customer uses T/rework
POST {{M}}/rework
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"message":"Please rework within the authorized scope and propose a new visit for occupant consent."}

### Public review only after completed external job; provider members cannot self-rate
POST {{T}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"rating":5,"comment":"The agreed repair was completed carefully.","publishReview":true}

### Internal business note; hidden from occupant/provider and their inboxes
POST {{M}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"requestId":"{{$uuid}}","version":{{workVersion}},"visibility":"INTERNAL","message":"Internal coordination note for property administrators."}

### Work history (visibility depends on current participant)
GET {{T}}/history?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Private evidence metadata and content
GET {{T}}/evidence
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Exact evidence image still checks request/participant scope
GET {{T}}/evidence/{{imageId}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Tenant dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/v1/me/work-requests/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Property maintenance queue
GET {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/work-requests?status=SUBMITTED&priority=HIGH
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### Provider jobs/dashboard
GET {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/{{providerId}}/service-jobs/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}

### Provider calendar; from/to window max 31 days
GET {{host}}/api/v1/organizations/{{providerId}}/service-jobs/calendar?from={{startAt}}&to={{endAt}}
Authorization: Bearer {{providerToken}}
